== 1. Definitions ==

"Ensia" means the software project distributed under the AGPLv3 together
with this Exception, including its source code, LLVM IR transformation
passes, injected code blocks, and runtime components.

"Target Program" means a program that is processed by Ensia, or that
combines or links with Ensia-provided code, runtime components, or
transformation blocks.

"Output" means any binary, executable, object file, library, or other
artifact produced by processing a Target Program with Ensia (including
through LLVM IR transformations), including artifacts into which Ensia has
injected or linked code.

"Eligible Target Code" means the code of a Target Program that is
independent of, and not itself derived from, Ensia. Code that is itself
part of Ensia, or derived from Ensia, is not Eligible Target Code.

